sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant Board
  participant Harness
  participant Policy
  participant Desktop
  participant Egress
  participant Evidence
  User->>Board: Move ticket to Ready for Agent
  Board->>Harness: Start run
  Harness->>Policy: Build context and capability scope
  Harness->>Desktop: Execute file/terminal/browser tool
  Desktop-->>Harness: Tool result
  Harness->>Policy: Risk check
  Policy-->>User: Approval request if needed
  Harness->>Egress: Governed API/credential access
  Harness->>Evidence: Store logs, diffs, screenshots, tests
  Evidence-->>Board: Evidence packet
